@startuml
' UniLib PA3 N1-W1 | conceptual domain model, no operations
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
class User <<concept>>
class Reader <<role>>
class Librarian <<role>>
class Administrator <<role>>
class BookTitle <<concept>>
class BookCopy <<concept>>
class Loan <<concept>>
class Reservation <<concept>>
Reader -up-|> User
Librarian -up-|> User
Administrator -up-|> User
BookTitle "1" -- "0..*" BookCopy : has
Reader "1" -- "0..*" Loan : borrows
BookCopy "1" -- "0..*" Loan : records history
Reader "1" -- "0..*" Reservation : places
BookTitle "1" -- "0..*" Reservation : requests
BookCopy "0..1" -- "0..*" Reservation : held copy (historical)
note right of User
  Logical specialization for roles only.
  Persisted in one users table with role enum.
  No Reader/Librarian/Admin tables in Q1 schema.
end note
note bottom of Loan
  Overdue is derived from dueAt and returnedAt,
  not a database status enum.
end note
note bottom of Reservation
  heldCopyId nullable until allocation;
  only one active hold per copy is enforced in DB.
end note
@enduml
